observed = "Handler leaves eventBus as a nil eventBusUnsubscriber, then websocketDisconnectFn dereferences it on every disconnect. wsConnection.Stop invokes that callback before cancellation and readRoutine reaches panic recovery instead of closing its reader-quit signal normally."
expected = "The inspection service must remain available when an operator closes a WebSocket and must not invoke an uninitialized service."
proposal = "In consensus/internal/inspect/rpc/rpc.go remove subscription cleanup for this read-only route set or inject the actual event bus; prove connect, read and disconnect leave the inspector alive."
